      "titleEn": "New research shows how AMIE, our medical AI, could help manage health conditions.",
      "summaryZh": "发表在《自然》杂志上的研究显示，我们的对话式AI系统在复杂疾病管理方面与初级保健医生相当。",
      "summaryEn": "Research in 'Nature' shows our conversational AI system matches primary care physicians in complex disease management.",
      "keywords": [
